{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_malzahar_void": {
        "attack": "【附加包】射出虚空弹。被动<#ff9028ff>虚空穿越<>：受到的伤害减少90%并<#ef5350ff>免疫控制<>；被非小兵单位打中<#ffb900ff>0.25秒<>后消失，<#ffb900ff>12秒<>内未受到英雄伤害时重新获得。",
        "skill": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>煞星幻象<>：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内造成<#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，目标死亡时立刻跳到最近的敌人身上（优先英雄），可以一直跳。<#ff9028ff>虚空虫群<>随之撕咬目标，每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>造成<#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_malzahar_void": {
        "attack": "【附加包】射出虛空彈。被動<#ff9028ff>虛空象限<>：受到的傷害減少90%並<#ef5350ff>免疫控場<>；被非小兵單位打中<#ffb900ff>0.25秒<>後消失，<#ffb900ff>12秒<>內未受到英雄傷害時重新獲得。",
        "skill": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>煞星幻象<>：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>內造成<#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，目標死亡時立刻跳到最近的敵人身上（優先英雄），可以一直跳。<#ff9028ff>召喚虛靈<>隨之撕咬目標，每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>造成<#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_malzahar_void": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] Fires a void bolt. Passive <#ff9028ff>Void Shift<>: takes 90% less damage and is <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<>; it fades <#ffb900ff>0.25s<> after a non-minion hit and returns after <#ffb900ff>12s<> without champion damage.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Malefic Visions<>: deals <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>4s<>; whenever the target dies, the vision jumps at once to the nearest enemy, champions first. <#ff9028ff>Void Swarm<>: voidlings bite the target, <#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_malzahar_void": {
        "attack": "[애드온] 공허의 화살을 쏩니다. 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>공허 태세<>: 받는 피해 90% 감소, <#ef5350ff>군중 제어 면역<>; 미니언이 아닌 적에게 맞고 <#ffb900ff>0.25초<> 뒤 사라지며, <#ffb900ff>12초<> 동안 챔피언 피해를 받지 않으면 다시 생깁니다.",
        "skill": "[애드온] <#ff9028ff>재앙의 환상<>: <#ffb900ff>4초<>에 걸쳐 <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, 대상이 죽을 때마다 가장 가까운 적(챔피언 우선)에게 바로 옮겨갑니다. <#ff9028ff>공허의 무리<>: 공허충이 대상을 물어 <#ffb900ff>0.5초<>마다 <#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_malzahar_void": {
        "attack": "【アドオン】ヴォイドの弾を放つ。自動効果<#ff9028ff>ヴォイドシフト<>：受けるダメージ90%減少、<#ef5350ff>行動妨害無効<>；ミニオン以外の攻撃を受けて<#ffb900ff>0.25秒<>後に消え、<#ffb900ff>12秒<>チャンピオンのダメージを受けないと再び得る。",
        "skill": "【アドオン】<#ff9028ff>虚性侵蝕<>：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>かけて<#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、対象が倒れるたびに最も近い敵（チャンピオン優先）へすぐ移る。<#ff9028ff>ヴォイドスワーム<>：ヴォイドリングが対象に噛みつき<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>ごとに<#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。"
      }
    }
  }
}
